course: dictionary
lesson: 581
title: Autobiography
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: An autobiography is a book or story about a person's life, written by that person. The word has a clear clue inside it: auto means self, so it is writing about yourself. A pupil might be asked to «write your autobiography», starting with the day they were born.
explain: The words «I» and «my» are the big clue. When a text says «I was born in a small village», the writer is telling their own story. Autobiographies also tell events in time order, from the beginning to the end.
explain: Do not mix it up with a biography. A biography is written by someone else, about a person. «In her autobiography, she remembers her first day at school» means she wrote the story herself, from her own memory.
fact: An autobiography is written by the person it is about.
fact: Autobiographies usually use «I», the past tense and events in time order.
fact: Auto means self, so an autobiography is writing about yourself.
fact: A biography is written by someone else about a person.
fact: Autobiography is a noun, and it is also the name of a kind of writing, called a genre.
exercise: «In her autobiography, she tells us about growing up on a farm.» What is an autobiography? | *A book about a person's life, written by that person | A story where the animals talk | A book about a person's life, written by someone else | A map of a farm
exercise: Which part of autobiography means self? | pre | re | tri | *auto
exercise: Which sentence is most likely from an autobiography? | *I was born in a small village, and my first memory is of the sea. | The bicycle has two wheels and a bell. | Gandalf, a wizard, walks through the hills with a staff. | Ada was born in a small village, and her first memory is of the sea.
test: Nadia says, «I will write my autobiography this term.» What does she plan to write? | *A story about her own life, written by herself | A book about the life of a famous scientist | A story about a dragon she invented | A list of her favourite bicycles
test: Which word means the same as writing about your own life? | tricycle | biography | misread | *autobiography
exam: Ravi says, «A biography and an autobiography both tell a life story.» Which difference is correct? | An autobiography is always a made-up story about animals | *A biography is written by someone else, and an autobiography is written by the person it is about | They are the same, and only the title is different | A biography uses «I» and an autobiography uses «you»
